('area:grand-massif','pass','line',25,'A week in Flaine','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.0.who'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',26,'The full pass at {{f:F000533}} for six days; the Flaine pass at {{f:F000699}} a day suits a short stay in the bowl.',array['F000533','F000699']::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.0.what'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',27,'A week in Samoëns, Morillon or Les Carroz','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.1.who'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',28,'The Villages pass at {{f:F000704}} covers {{f:F000656}} of piste; the full pass adds Flaine and the Cascades for {{diff:F000533,F000704}} more.',array['F000533','F000656','F000704']::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.1.what'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',29,'Families','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.2.who'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',30,'Children under {{f:F000688|n}} ski free by the day and pay {{f:F000693}} for two to seven days; a child''s day on the full pass costs {{f:F000691}}.',array['F000688','F000691','F000693']::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.2.what'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',31,'First days on skis','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.3.who'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',32,'The Flaine beginner pass at {{f:F000701}} a day, or Sixt''s beginner day at {{f:F000707}}.',array['F000701','F000707']::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.3.what'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',33,'Half days','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.4.who'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',34,'Four consecutive hours cost {{f:F000692}} on the full pass and {{f:F000700}} in Flaine.',array['F000692','F000700']::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.4.what'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',35,'A season','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.5.who'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','line',36,'The season pass costs {{f:F000694}}, or {{f:F000696}} bought by 15 November.',array['F000694','F000696']::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.5.what'),
('area:grand-massif','pass','note',1,'Walkers can ride the Grandes Platières cable car for {{f:F000702}} return, and the gondolas of the Giffre valley for {{f:F000708}}.',array['F000702','F000708']::text[],'review','loader','pass.after'),
('area:grand-massif','access','heading',0,'Getting there and choosing a base','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.h2'),
('area:grand-massif','access','para',0,'By the fastest road Geneva airport is {{f:F000642}} from Les Carroz and {{f:F000643}} from Flaine, Lyon airport {{f:F000719|n}} to {{f:F000720}} away and Chambéry {{f:F000721|n}} to {{f:F000722}}. The A40 motorway runs up the Arve valley to Cluses, where one road climbs south to Les Carroz and Flaine and another follows the Giffre east to Morillon, Samoëns and Sixt.',array['F000642','F000643','F000719','F000720','F000721','F000722']::text[],'review','loader','access.paras.0'),
('area:grand-massif','access','para',1,'Cluses station is the way in by train. Altibus runs the Les Carroz Flaine Express from the bus station just outside it and line Y94 up the valley to Samoëns and Sixt; Les Carroz is about ten kilometres from the station and Flaine about thirty, and Guide Ski notes that the Flaine buses run by reservation in winter. Free skibuses join Samoëns, its two gondolas and Sixt, and in Flaine free shuttles link Forêt, Les Gérats, Le Hameau and the Col de Pierre Carrée to the Forum.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.paras.1'),
('area:grand-massif','access','para',2,'Under the Loi Montagne, winter tyres or chains carried in the car are required from November to March in the listed mountain communes of Haute-Savoie. The Grand Massif Express car park in Samoëns has {{f:F000680}} spaces and charges in winter, the Vercland car park has {{f:F000681}} free spaces, and Les Carroz has about {{f:F000682}} free spaces at the foot of its slopes.',array['F000680','F000681','F000682']::text[],'review','loader','access.paras.2'),
('area:grand-massif','access','note',0,'Road distances are the fastest route by the OSRM router on OpenStreetMap data, without traffic or snow. Buses: <a href="https://www.altibus.com/en/arriving-by-train/cluses">Altibus</a> and <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=7797">Guide Ski for Flaine</a>. Winter equipment rules: <a href="https://www.allopneus.com/guide-pratique/auto/conseils-pneu/loi-montagne-haute-savoie">Allopneus</a> (October 2026). Parking: <a href="https://www.samoens.com/en/samoens-grand-massif-area/">the Samoëns tourist office</a> and <a href="https://www.skiinfo.fr/news/le-grand-massif-flaine-vs-les-carroz">Skiinfo</a>.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.accessNote'),
('area:grand-massif','access','heading',1,'How far each base reaches','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.basesH3'),
('area:grand-massif','access','para',3,'Samoëns 1600 is the hub. From the top of the Grand Massif Express, Flaine, Les Carroz and Morillon 1100 are each {{f:F000794|w}} lift ride away, and a lift top above 2,400 m is {{f:F000799|w}}.',array['F000794','F000799']::text[],'review','loader','access.basesParas.0'),
('area:grand-massif','access','para',4,'Flaine is the base for the high skiing: the Grandes Platières is {{f:F000757|w}} lift rides from the village lifts. The other villages are further: Les Carroz needs {{f:F000753|w}} rides and Morillon 1100 {{f:F000755|w}}.',array['F000753','F000755','F000757']::text[],'review','loader','access.basesParas.1'),
('area:grand-massif','access','para',5,'The valley villages trade a first lift for their charm. Samoëns village is {{f:F000772|w}} gondola ride from Samoëns 1600 and Morillon village {{f:F000767|w}} from Morillon 1100, while Morillon village is {{f:F000769|w}} lift rides from the top of the area. Sixt has no lift into the area, so the skibus to Samoëns comes first.',array['F000767','F000769','F000772']::text[],'review','loader','access.basesParas.2'),
('area:grand-massif','access','caption',0,'Lift rides from each base','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.basesCaption'),
