('area:grand-massif','compare','note',0,'Size, lifts, heights and grade split: skiresort.com for <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/le-grand-massif-flaine-les-carroz-morillon-samoens-sixt/">the Grand Massif</a>, <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-portes-du-soleil-morzine-avoriaz-les-gets-chatel-morgins-champery/">the Portes du Soleil</a>, <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/megeve-saint-gervais/">Megève and Saint-Gervais</a> with <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-portes-du-mont-blanc-combloux-megeve-le-jaillet-la-giettaz/">Les Portes du Mont-Blanc</a> (added together for Évasion Mont Blanc) and <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/la-clusaz-manigod/">La Clusaz Manigod</a>. Prices: <a href="https://www.alti-mag.com/tarifs-forfaits-de-ski/tarifs-forfaits-ski-alpes/tarifs-forfaits-ski-alpes-du-nord">Alti-Mag for the Northern Alps</a>, <a href="https://www.alti-mag.com/domaines-skiables/la-clusaz-manigod">Alti-Mag for La Clusaz</a> and <a href="https://www.flaine.com/en/winter/skiing-snowsports/ski-passes/ski-passes.htm">the Flaine tourist office</a>. Snowfall: ERA5 via <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/historical-weather-api">Open-Meteo</a>, each area''s grid cell at 1,600 m. Road: the OSRM router on OpenStreetMap data.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','compare.note'),
