('area:grand-massif','method','heading',0,'Figures that disagree','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.conflictsH3'),
('area:grand-massif','method','line',48,'Alti-Mag counts {{f:F000651}} lifts and {{f:F000645}} runs, the Samoëns tourist office and Guide Ski {{f:F000652}} lifts and {{f:F000650}} runs, Wikipedia {{f:F000653}} lifts and skiresort.com {{f:F000524}}; the page uses Alti-Mag''s runs and skiresort.com''s lifts and grades. Alti-Mag puts the lowest point at {{f:F000654}} and skiresort.com at {{f:F000525}}. Guide Ski opens the Grand Massif on {{f:F000661|dm}} and the Flaine tourist office on {{f:F000659|dm}}. Skiinfo prices a Grand Massif day at {{f:F000698}} on weekdays and a week at {{f:F000697}}, and the Villages pass at {{f:F000705}} a day and {{f:F000706}} a week, against {{f:F000690}}, {{f:F000703}} and {{f:F000704}} from the tourist office and Alti-Mag.',array['F000524','F000525','F000645','F000650','F000651','F000652','F000653','F000654','F000659','F000661','F000690','F000697','F000698','F000703','F000704','F000705','F000706']::text[],'review','loader','method.conflicts'),
('area:grand-massif','method','line',49,'Research of 26 October 2026. Size, runs, lifts and passes: <a href="https://www.alti-mag.com/domaines-skiables/le-grand-massif">Alti-Mag</a>, <a href="https://www.alti-mag.com/domaines-skiables/villages-grand-massif">Alti-Mag for the Villages</a>, <a href="https://www.alti-mag.com/domaines-skiables/flaine">Alti-Mag for Flaine</a>, <a href="https://www.flaine.com/en/winter/skiing-snowsports/ski-passes/ski-passes.htm">the Flaine tourist office</a>, <a href="https://www.samoens.com/en/samoens-grand-massif-area/">the Samoëns tourist office</a>, <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=7797">Guide Ski for Flaine</a>, <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=10423">Guide Ski for Sixt</a>, <a href="https://www.skiinfo.fr/alpes-du-nord/flaine/forfaits-de-ski.html">Skiinfo for Flaine</a>, <a href="https://www.skiinfo.fr/alpes-du-nord/samoens/forfaits-de-ski.html">for Samoëns</a>, <a href="https://www.skiinfo.fr/alpes-du-nord/les-carroz/forfaits-de-ski.html">for Les Carroz</a> and <a href="https://www.skiinfo.fr/alpes-du-nord/sixt-fer-a-cheval/forfaits-de-ski.html">for Sixt</a>, and <a href="https://www.grand-massif.com/en/skipass-prices/">the lift company</a>. Measured size and grades: <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/le-grand-massif-flaine-les-carroz-morillon-samoens-sixt/">skiresort.com</a>. The Cascades: <a href="https://www.mon-sejour-en-montagne.com/experience/skier-14-km-dans-une-reserve-naturelle-l-experience-unique-de-la-piste-des-cascades/">Mon séjour en montagne</a>. History: Wikipedia for <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flaine">Flaine</a> and <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Massif">the Grand Massif</a>. Snowfall: ERA5 via <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/historical-weather-api">Open-Meteo</a>, weather data by Open-Meteo.com. Map: © OpenStreetMap contributors. Photos: Wikimedia Commons.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.sources');
